	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Somme de deux enregistrements]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=2775#p2775"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT s.prix+t.prix AS somme
FROM table as s, table as t
WHERE s.source=t.target
AND s.id=1
AND t.id=2</code></pre></div>]]></content>
